{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WONDER, FEAR, HAPPINESS, SADNESS</strong> and the <strong>THRILL </strong> of <strong>DISCOVERY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of Journey, The Stanly Pairable, and The First Tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an emotional, intimate story by the character you play with an ending that will twist your mind. Experience a roller coaster of emotions in this new unexplored world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the deep ocean a creative, beautiful world awaits. Unravel an amazing story about the player at your hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/57c03db3eebb6060955786c2ddfeb896.poster.avif?t=1763889596\" width=518 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/57c03db3eebb6060955786c2ddfeb896.webm?t=1763889596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/57c03db3eebb6060955786c2ddfeb896.mp4?t=1763889596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a Submarine through the depths of the ocean unlock new abilities and discover puzzles, bosses merged in with the story the player is telling you along your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over and hour  focused on story and extra for those true explorers, Meet new CHARACTERS and ENEMIES in life you will have to fight for survival and for what's really yours. Do not give up on this story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/b6e1d5e553f73b22132ce78e31c446a4.poster.